"rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="erd-00-g-58"><mxGeometry x="13" y="86" width="200" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="erd-00-ch-62" value="&lt;b&gt;Status&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;Status value · C&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="erd-00-g-58"><mxGeometry x="227" y="86" width="200" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="erd-00-ch-63" value="&lt;b&gt;StatusTransition&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;Allowed status transition · C&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="erd-00-g-58"><mxGeometry x="13" y="136" width="200" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="lerd-full" name="ERD-FULL Complete logical ERD (53 entities)"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="3700" pageHeight="2800" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" value="" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" value="" /><mxCell id="erd-full-note-1" value="&lt;b&gt;Diagram ID:&lt;/b&gt; DGM-LERD-FULL&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Name:&lt;/b&gt; Logical ERD – Complete model (53 entities)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notation:&lt;/b&gt; Logical ERD, Crow's Foot (SRS level, DBMS-independent)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Purpose:&lt;/b&gt; Shows all 53 entities and all 109 named relationships of the OMTS data model on one page; status_id FKs of 25 entities to Status are not drawn (SRS 3.4)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scope:&lt;/b&gt; Each entity appears once with its keys (PK / AK); attributes, FKs and constraints are in the entity tables of SRS 3.2 (group pages ERD-01 … ERD-09 belong to the SDS)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Related SRS:&lt;/b&gt; 3.2 Data model (53 entities), OMTS SRS v5.9 (20/10/2026)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Related use cases:&lt;/b&gt; UC-ACC-01 … UC-ADM-04 (81 UCs)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Design decisions shown:&lt;/b&gt; Frame and colour = entity group 1–9 of SRS 3.2&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Assumptions/TBD:&lt;/b&gt; Open points: SRS V.3.2" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#fff8e1;strokeColor=#b7a56a;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="760" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="erd-full-note-2" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend (logical ERD)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK primary key (underlined) · FK foreign key (italic) · AK alternate key (unique)&lt;br&gt;FK rule: the key of the ┼ / o┼ (one) side is stored as FK on the many side; associative entities use a composite PK of two FKs&lt;br&gt;Crow's Foot: ┼ exactly one · o┼ zero or one · o&lt; zero or many · ┼&lt; one or many&lt;br&gt;Read both ways: Customer –placing→ SalesOrder = a Customer places 0..n SalesOrders; reverse: a SalesOrder is placed by exactly 1 Customer&lt;br&gt;Second line of each entity: Vietnamese name · C/I status. No data types (specified in the SDS)&lt;br&gt;Full model: each entity once, keys only; frame and colour = entity group of SRS 3.2&lt;br&gt;C: confirmed from source · I: inferred to preserve rules&lt;br&gt;*_by attributes (recorder / approver): user who acted, no relationship drawn · Money: VND, multiples of 1,000" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#fff8e1;strokeColor=#b7a56a;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="830" y="20" width="520" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="erd-full-g-3" value="3. Seed, cultivation and water (9)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff9f0;strokeColor=#a66a00;opacity=45;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#a66a00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="300" width="1030" height="750" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="erd-full-t-4" value="&lt;b&gt;OysterSeedType&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Loại giống hàu · C&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=table;startSize=46;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayout;fixedRows=1;rowLines=0;fontStyle=0;align=center;resizeLast=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff9f0;strokeColor=#a66a00;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="80" y="350" width="230" height="88" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="erd-full-r-5" value="" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;fillColor=none;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;top=0;left=0;right=0;bottom=0;strokeColor=#a66a00;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="erd-full-t-4"><mxGeometry y="46" width="230" height="42" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="erd-full-k-6" value="PK" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;fontStyle=1;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;" vertex="1" parent="erd-full-r-5"><mxGeometry width="50" height="42" as="geometry"><mxRectangle width="50" height="42" as="alternateBounds" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="erd-full-c-7" value="seed_type_id" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=3;spacingLeft=6;overflow=hidden;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=4;" vertex="1" parent="erd-full-r-5"><mxGeometry x="50" width="180" height="42" as="geometry"><mxRectangle width="180" height="42" as="alternateBounds" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="erd-full-t-8" value="&lt;b&gt;SeedSupplier&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;font-weight:normal&quot;&gt;Nhà cung cấp giống · C&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=table;startSize=46;container=1;collapsible=0;childLayout=tableLayou